    {
      "name": "Open Index List",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "首页与工具页的开放列表：2px 石墨粗线分节，1px 规则线分行。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-open-index\"><div class=\"ds-open-index-heading\"><h2>研究看板与工具</h2><a href=\"#\">全部工具</a></div><ul><li><h3><a href=\"#\">A 股小微盘轮动策略</a></h3><p>最近交易日的目标持仓、调仓记录，以及不同持股数量下的历史收益与回撤。</p><span class=\"ds-open-index-aside\">交易日盘后更新</span></li></ul></section>",
      "css": ".ds-open-index{font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-open-index-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding-bottom:16px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--site-ink,#151b26)}.ds-open-index-heading h2{margin:0;color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}.ds-open-index-heading>a{color:var(--site-link,#075a9c);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-open-index ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}.ds-open-index li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:6px 32px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--site-line,#d8dee7)}.ds-open-index h3{grid-column:1;margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5}.ds-open-index h3 a{color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-open-index h3 a:hover,.ds-open-index h3 a:focus-visible{color:var(--site-link,#075a9c);text-decoration:underline}.ds-open-index li>p{grid-column:1;max-width:46rem;margin:0;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}.ds-open-index-aside{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;padding-top:3px;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Archive Status",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "明确标示停止刷新或退出运行的历史研究。",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-archive-notice\"><strong>历史研究档案</strong><p>数据已停止自动刷新，请核对截至日。</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-archive-notice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--site-signal,#b98200) 55%,var(--site-line,#d8dee7));border-top:3px solid var(--site-signal,#b98200);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--site-signal,#b98200) 7%,var(--site-panel,#ffffff));padding:20px 24px;color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-archive-notice p{margin:0;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);line-height:1.7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Site Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "公开主线的稳定入口。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a href=\"#\">首页</a><a href=\"#\">作品</a><a href=\"#\">文章</a><a href=\"#\">工具</a><a href=\"#\">关于</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav a{color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);font-size:14px;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:6px}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--site-link-strong,#034270);text-decoration:underline}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--site-link,#075a9c) 76%,white);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Menu",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "720px 以下用原生 details 展开的移动导航浮层。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-mobile-menu\" open><summary aria-label=\"打开导航菜单\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"/></svg></summary><nav class=\"ds-mobile-menu-nav\"><a href=\"#\">首页</a><a href=\"#\">作品</a><a href=\"#\">文章</a><a href=\"#\">工具</a><a href=\"#\">关于</a></nav></details>",
      "css": ".ds-mobile-menu{position:relative;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-mobile-menu>summary{width:38px;height:38px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.ds-mobile-menu>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-mobile-menu>summary:hover{color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--site-line,#d8dee7) 36%,transparent)}.ds-mobile-menu svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:1.8}.ds-mobile-menu-nav{position:absolute;top:48px;right:0;width:190px;display:grid;gap:0;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--site-line,#d8dee7);border-radius:14px;background:var(--site-panel,#ffffff);box-shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(16,26,41,0.14)}.ds-mobile-menu-nav a{padding:11px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);font-size:14px;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none}.ds-mobile-menu-nav a:hover,.ds-mobile-menu-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--site-link-strong,#034270);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Consent Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "唯一带阴影的悬浮层：右下角统计偏好询问。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-consent-panel\" aria-label=\"统计偏好\"><div><strong>是否允许匿名访问统计？</strong><p>只有你同意后才会加载统计脚本。拒绝不会影响网站功能。<a href=\"#\">了解详情</a></p></div><div class=\"ds-consent-panel-actions\"><button type=\"button\">仅必要功能</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-consent-panel-primary\">允许匿名统计</button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-consent-panel{width:min(540px,100%);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--site-line,#d8dee7);border-radius:16px;background:var(--site-panel,#ffffff);box-shadow:0 18px 56px rgba(16,26,41,0.18);color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-consent-panel strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.ds-consent-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--site-muted,#5f6b7a);font-size:13px;line-height:1.55}.ds-consent-panel a{margin-left:6px;color:var(--site-link,#075a9c);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-consent-panel-actions{display:grid;gap:7px}.ds-consent-panel-actions button{min-height:38px;border:1px solid var(--site-line,#d8dee7);border-radius:9px;padding:0 13px;background:transparent;color:var(--site-ink,#151b26);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-consent-panel-actions button:hover{border-color:var(--site-link,#075a9c)}.ds-consent-panel-actions .ds-consent-panel-primary{border-color:var(--site-link,#075a9c);background:var(--site-link,#075a9c);color:#fff}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "个人档案索引",
    "overview": "c9cu 的界面像一份由本人持续整理的档案索引：先给身份和状态，再给证据与正文。视觉不模拟机构媒体，也不以促销组件制造权威感；冷色纸面、细规则线和开放列表承担主要秩序。\n\n展示层使用编辑式衬线字形成个人出版物的气质，正文与导航保持清楚克制。深蓝只承担链接、主证据和关键动作，琥珀色只表示状态或边界。",
    "keyCharacteristics": ["编辑式大标题与高可读正文并置。", "依靠网格、留白和细规则线组织内容。", "明暗主题共享同一语义色彩关系。", "状态、来源和限制是视觉层级的一部分。"],
    "rules": [
      { "name": "The Rare Accent Rule", "body": "档案蓝负责行动和证据，状态琥珀负责状态；两者不互相代替，也不把整页染成强调色。", "section": "colors" },
      { "name": "The Two-Voice Rule", "body": "衬线只负责展示级标题；正文、导航、状态和交互全部使用无衬线。", "section": "typography" },
      { "name": "The Open Index Rule", "body": "同类内容优先使用规则线分隔的开放列表；只有确实需要独立承载或浮层语义时才使用封闭面板。", "section": "layout" },
      { "name": "The Flat-by-Default Rule", "body": "正文、列表、信任说明和状态提示保持平面；结构先靠规则线和留白完成。", "section": "elevation" }
    ],
    "dos": ["Do 先展示作者、日期、状态、来源或处理位置，再要求访客相信结果。", "Do 用规则线、留白和文字层级组织跨主题内容。", "Do 让移动端从多栏自然重排为单列，并保持页面无横向溢出。", "Do 在明暗主题中保持档案蓝、状态琥珀和中性色的语义一致。"],
    "donts": ["Don't 使用装饰性眉题、全大写口号或无信息量徽章填充标题上方。", "Don't 把每项内容包装成同尺寸圆角卡片。", "Don't 用单侧粗色条、发光阴影、渐变文字或表情符号代替层级。", "Don't 编造头像、资历、统计数字或机构背书来制造可信度。"]
  }
}
